## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: delta-dvp12ss211s
name: "Delta Electronics DVP12SS211S — DVP-SS2 Slim PLC; 32-bit CPU; 0.35µs basic inst; 8k steps program; 5k words data; 8DI+4DO PNP transistor; 4×10kHz PTO (Y0-Y3); 8×HSC (4×20kHz+4×10kHz); PWM DA output; RS-232+RS-485 Modbus; 480 I/O max; 24VDC; 25.2mm ultra-slim DIN rail"
manufacturer: "Delta Electronics"
mcu: "Delta DVP-SS2 32-bit CPU — 0.35µs LD; 8k steps; 5k words D reg; 8 HSC (4×20kHz+4×10kHz); 4×PTO 10kHz; PID auto-tune; RS-232+RS-485 Modbus ASCII/RTU; WPLSoft/ISPSoft; IEC-61131 IL+SFC; battery-free program retention"
category: plc
image: delta-dvp12ss211s.svg
url: "https://www.deltaww.com/en-US/products/PLC-Programmable-Logic-Controllers/253"

